# the MOD track (docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-26-mod-track-design.md): ALGORITHM past WEAVE reaches it, SEQ (or
# EDIT) its Lanes page. A lane added from SEL's pickers (T2, Filter, cutoff) and one learned from a knob turned
# elsewhere (the master filter's mix); values tapped on (the target's now) and set with a step held and KNOB 4; the shape
# or step in SEL's "this lane" (SEL on a lane's row picks it) and by PRESETS on the page; the lane picked moved to
# another target (TARGET TRACK, PAGE, KNOB; LEARN TARGET), its values kept; the list in sections (lanes, this lane,
# new lane); a scene with none ("-"): the page and the list say so, KNOB 1 picks one;
# ALGORITHM through the lanes, then on to the tracks; the knob a lane holds shows the value playing (MOD VIEW) and takes
# over from it; REC held while playing writes the knob's moves; Arrange's KNOB 4 (the scene's MOD pattern) and black
# key 11 (its mute); the grid by the scale; the reader's words; saved and loaded
wait 300
preset 2 acid_line acid
pat 2 1 16 1 60 0
notes 2 1 1 0.5 100 A1
knob 2 cut 40
listen
tap SEQ
spin ALGO 11
wait 600
expect trk 14
expect page Lanes
said Lanes
# a new project's scene plays no MOD pattern ("-"): the page says so (not another pattern's lanes), KNOB 1 picks one
expect smod1 0
expect modsel 0
shot mod_none.png
tap SEL
wait 100
rowval NO MOD PATTERN = KNOB 1 picks one
norow ADD LANE
shot mod_none_list.png
tap HOME
wait 100
spin K1 1
expect smod1 1
wait 100
shot mod_empty.png
# SEL: ADD LANE from the pickers (the "new lane" section)
tap SEL
wait 100
rowval NO LANES YET = add one below
row TRACK
spin ALGO 1
expect rowval TRACK T2
row PAGE
turn ALGO 4
expect rowval PAGE Filter
expect rowval KNOB cutoff
wait 100
shot mod_picker.png
row ADD LANE
tap SEL
wait 100
expect modlanes 1 1
expect modglide 1 1 1
expect modshape 1 1 4
said LANE ADDED T2 cutoff
# the lane's values: a tap on step 1 takes the knob's (40), step 9 held and KNOB 4 turned to 100
tapkey w0
wait 100
expect modval 1 2 cut 1 40
key w8 down
wait 100
spin K4 60
wait 100
key w8 up
expect modval 1 2 cut 9 100
expect par2.cut 40
# a tap on a value takes it off; again puts it back
tapkey w4
expect modval 1 2 cut 5 40
tapkey w4
expect modval 1 2 cut 5 255
# KNOB 1: the scene plays P1 (above); KNOB 2 the length (16), KNOB 3 a step a beat
expect smod1 1
turn K3 3
wait 400
shot mod_glide.png
# playing: the lane (smooth, as a new lane starts) from 40 to 100 over steps 1 to 9 (a beat each): near the middle
# of the way at the end of step 4, ~70 (smooth is steepest there: a little under, as it is a little before)
tap PLAY
bars 1
expect modpat 1
expect modpos 4
expect live2.cut >62
expect live2.cut <71
wait 200
shot mod_playing.png
# KNOB 4 sets the lane's value on the step last tapped (step 5, empty: from the knob's 40), never the cutoff itself
# (the hand takes over on the parameter's own page: modknobs.xy); the lane plays on
spin K4 10
wait 50
expect modval 1 2 cut 5 50
expect par2.cut 40
shot mod_tap.png
bars 1
expect live2.cut >40
# LEARN: the master filter's mix turned on GLO's page becomes a lane, the Lanes page back
tap SEL
wait 100
row LEARN
tap SEL
wait 100
expect page Lanes
tap GLO
turn SELECT 5
expect page Master_filter
spin K3 -10
wait 100
expect page Lanes
expect modlanes 1 2
expect modglide 1 2 1
# lane 2 picked, no step tapped on it: KNOB 4 sets nothing
spin K4 5
wait 50
said HOLD A STEP
# the list in sections: lanes, this lane (the learned one, picked), new lane
tap SEL
wait 100
expect rowval LANE_2 master_mix,_smooth
rowval lanes = 
rowval this lane: 2, master mix = 
rowval new lane = 
shot mod_lanes.png
# SEL on lane 1's row picks it (the list stays, its section renamed); ALGORITHM on lane 2's row changes nothing (the
# lanes section only lists them): lane 1 stays picked, lane 2 as it was
row LANE 1
tap SEL
wait 100
expect listopen 1
expect modsel 1
rowval this lane: 1, T2 cutoff = 
rowval SHAPE = smooth
rowval TARGET TRACK = T2
rowval TARGET PAGE = Filter
rowval TARGET KNOB = cutoff
row LANE 2
spin ALGO -1
expect modglide 1 2 1
expect modsel 1
rowval this lane: 1, T2 cutoff = 
shot mod_sections.png
row LANE 2
tap SEL
wait 100
expect modsel 2
# this lane's SHAPE: ALGORITHM left a shape at a time (smooth, ease out, ease in, linear, step), stopping at step
row SHAPE
spin ALGO -1
expect modshape 1 2 3
said EASE OUT master mix
spin ALGO -1
spin ALGO -1
spin ALGO -1
spin ALGO -1
expect modshape 1 2 0
expect modglide 1 2 0
said STEP master mix
# its target: TARGET KNOB left, the master's melodic filter (its steps and values kept), right, the mix's again;
# TARGET TRACK right from the master: T1 (its first page's first knob a lane can take); left: the master again
row TARGET KNOB
spin ALGO -1
said TARGET master melodic
expect modlanes 1 2
expect modval 1 mst melf 1 255
rowval this lane: 2, master melodic = 
spin ALGO 1
said TARGET master mix
rowval TARGET PAGE = Master filter
row TARGET TRACK
spin ALGO 1
rowval TARGET TRACK = T1
expect modlanes 1 2
spin ALGO -1
rowval TARGET TRACK = master
row TARGET PAGE
rowval TARGET PAGE = Master EQ
spin ALGO 1
spin ALGO 1
rowval TARGET PAGE = Master filter
row TARGET KNOB
spin ALGO 1
spin ALGO 1
rowval TARGET KNOB = mix
rowval this lane: 2, master mix = 
expect modglide 1 2 0
# LEARN TARGET: the next knob turned by hand is the lane's new target (GLO's Master filter: the melodic), the Lanes
# page back; then the mix again the same way
row LEARN TARGET
tap SEL
wait 100
expect page Lanes
tap GLO
wait 100
expect page Master_filter
spin K2 -10
wait 100
expect page Lanes
said TARGET master melodic
expect modlanes 1 2
expect modsel 2
tap SEL
wait 100
row LEARN TARGET
tap SEL
wait 100
tap GLO
wait 100
spin K3 1
wait 100
expect page Lanes
said TARGET master mix
# PRESETS on the page: the lane picked's next shape, round (step, linear, ease in, ease out, smooth, step)
turn PRESET 1
expect modshape 1 2 1
said LINEAR master mix
turn PRESET 1
turn PRESET 1
turn PRESET 1
expect modshape 1 2 4
said SMOOTH master mix
turn PRESET 1
expect modshape 1 2 0
expect modglide 1 2 0
wait 100
# ALGORITHM: lane 1 back, then past it to WEAVE (the tracks), and back to the MOD track
spin ALGO -1
expect trk 14
expect page Lanes
spin ALGO -1
expect trk 13
spin ALGO 1
expect trk 14
expect page Lanes
# REC held while playing: KNOB 4 (lane 1: cutoff) written on the steps as they play (three values before: 1, 5, 9; a
# step is a beat, half a second: the knob turned for two seconds writes four or five)
expect modvals 1 2 cut 3
press REC
turn K4 -20 100
release REC
expect modvals 1 2 cut >5
# 64 steps a bar each: the whole pattern on the page, the keys' bar shaded (OCT+ the next)
spin K2 48
turn K3 4
tap OCT+
wait 400
shot mod_64.png
spin K2 -48
turn K3 -4
tap OCT-
# Arrange: KNOB 4 the scene's MOD pattern (with T... none: "-"); black key 11 mutes it
tap HOME
wait 100
spin K4 -1
expect smod1 0
spin K4 1
expect smod1 1
tapkey b10
expect mute 1024
wait 200
shot mod_arrange.png
tapkey b10
expect mute 0
# a new scene: "-"
tapkey w1
wait 100
expect smod2 0
tap PLAY
# saved and loaded
projsave 1 mod
reboot
wait 400
expect smod1 1
expect smod2 0
expect modlanes 1 2
expect modval 1 2 cut 9 100
expect modval 1 mst mfilt 1 255
